# RFP Buddy currently runs entirely on local fixture data — no environment
# variables are required to run `npm run dev`.
#
# This file exists as a placeholder for future configuration (Supabase URL/
# anon key, Google Workspace OAuth client, etc.) once those integrations are
# implemented. Never commit real values — copy this file to `.env.local` and
# fill it in locally when those variables are introduced.
